{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage Platformer</strong>\u00a0(known as KeNi Adventure) is a fast-paced, precision platformer that delivers a relentless challenge for even the most skilled players. Prepare to embark on a journey filled with deviously designed levels, each packed with complex puzzles and brutal obstacles that demand mastery of timing, agility, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving platformer, your patience will be tested as much as your reflexes. Each level brings a unique twist, requiring quick thinking and precise movements to navigate deadly traps and reach the goal. Mistakes are part of the process\u2014learn from them, adapt, and overcome.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3293290?t=1769234830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769234830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293290/077ffc33f63c1eee594b013eed00d99e567c9014/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769234830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293290/077ffc33f63c1eee594b013eed00d99e567c9014/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769234830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rage Platformer</strong>\u00a0(known as KeNi Adventure) is a fast-paced, precision platformer that delivers a relentless challenge for even the most skilled players. Prepare to embark on a journey filled with deviously designed levels, each packed with complex puzzles and brutal obstacles that demand mastery of timing, agility, and wit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving pla